WEBVTT

00:01:03.610 --> 00:01:13.670
Episode of Dragon Ball Z, Goku demonstrated his incredible power by unleashing a Kamehameha wave that left Cell's body almost completely disintegrated.

00:01:14.170 --> 00:01:23.530
Unfortunately for our hero, however, the resilient android proved yet again that, when dealing with him, almost isn't quite good enough.

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:29.970
Thanks to the regenerative capabilities he inherited from Pickle...

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:33.720
Although Cell restored himself back to normal and continued with his fight.

00:01:37.290 --> 00:01:42.250
The voracious villain swarmed in on his prey, but Goku still had more fight left in him.

00:01:42.390 --> 00:01:47.990
And in one giant outburst, he let fly a furious foray that froze the ferocious android firm in his tracks.

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:51.690
But Goku's advantage was fleeting.

00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:59.860
For with what seemed like minimal effort, Cell reduced the Super Saiyan's tremendous onslaught into a simple fireworks display.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:03.930
The situation looked hopeless.

00:02:04.190 --> 00:02:07.390
Clearly unable to put a dent in Cell's impenetrable armor,

00:02:07.850 --> 00:02:10.410
Goku, the planet's last chance for survival,

00:02:10.710 --> 00:02:12.670
had but one remaining option.

00:02:13.880 --> 00:02:16.280
You win, Cell. I give up.

00:02:16.800 --> 00:02:18.960
Could this be the end for planet Earth?

00:02:19.160 --> 00:02:21.920
Has Goku really surrendered to the monstrous Cell?

00:02:22.140 --> 00:02:24.980
Find out today on Dragon Ball Z.

00:02:35.310 --> 00:02:36.890
Ancel, I give up.

00:02:37.700 --> 00:02:41.220
You know I wasn't sure when I came here today if I'd have what it takes to defeat you.

00:02:41.830 --> 00:02:43.330
But I now know that I don't.

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:47.520
Fighting against you has shown me that there's still a lot I have to work towards.

00:02:48.280 --> 00:02:52.580
We may be enemies, but today you taught me a valuable lesson about myself.

00:02:53.310 --> 00:02:55.590
And for what it's worth, I thank you.

00:03:00.440 --> 00:03:01.800
He's gone crazy.

00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:05.100
Maybe, Cell, there will be a time when you and I will have to face each other again.

00:03:05.100 --> 00:03:09.930
But as for right now, it's pointless for us to continue this fight.

00:03:10.090 --> 00:03:11.130
You must be joking.

00:03:12.350 --> 00:03:16.900
You can't just say, I give up and expect to walk away.

00:03:17.620 --> 00:03:18.380
Sure I can.

00:03:18.460 --> 00:03:20.290
You beat me fair and square.

00:03:20.980 --> 00:03:21.880
I give up.

00:03:24.040 --> 00:03:25.240
What's happening over there?

00:03:25.420 --> 00:03:26.480
Can you hear what they're saying?

00:03:27.060 --> 00:03:28.300
Yeah, just barely.

00:03:28.620 --> 00:03:29.980
Sounds like this guy's giving up.

00:03:30.830 --> 00:03:36.180
Figures a tiny little guy like that. I'm surprised the amateur lasted as long as he did

00:03:43.010 --> 00:03:47.690
Well Goku I hope you're willing to accept the consequences of your actions

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:53.620
You can give up if you wish but if there's no one left to fight me

00:03:53.620 --> 00:03:59.980
I'll have no choice but to reduce this entire planet to rubble not so fast sell just because I

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:04.240
stepping back doesn't mean the tournament is over there's still one more person for you to fight

00:04:04.240 --> 00:04:14.040
you're not serious who one of them and exactly which one of these pathetic specimens did you

00:04:14.040 --> 00:04:29.750
have in mind goku hmm trunks piccolo vegeta please don't waste my time it's hercule versus cell

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:31.950
One on Hercule.

00:04:32.410 --> 00:04:34.810
Now that our long-haired friend has come to his senses,

00:04:35.070 --> 00:04:36.410
you're Earth's only hope.

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:39.610
Give us your thoughts as you prepare for this historic battle.

00:04:39.910 --> 00:04:41.470
Ooh, tell us, Hercule.

00:04:41.700 --> 00:04:42.880
What are you going to do?

00:04:43.280 --> 00:04:44.760
What is the plan, maestro?

00:04:44.880 --> 00:04:45.060
Huh?

00:04:47.110 --> 00:04:48.530
Well, the first thing I'll do

00:04:48.530 --> 00:04:51.950
is show that green freak what a real champion's made of.

00:04:56.850 --> 00:04:58.020
Oh, no!

00:04:58.940 --> 00:04:59.760
Hercule has collapsed!

00:05:00.060 --> 00:05:03.130
Mr. Hercule, are you all right?

00:05:03.730 --> 00:05:05.050
It's my stomach!

00:05:06.810 --> 00:05:09.200
I really want to fight Sal.

00:05:09.530 --> 00:05:11.830
I'm going to whoop up on him real good.

00:05:12.010 --> 00:05:13.790
I'm going to cause him some bruising.

00:05:14.090 --> 00:05:15.130
Oh, but the pain!

00:05:17.820 --> 00:05:20.520
I've got some strong medicine right here.

00:05:20.720 --> 00:05:23.920
Take one of these pills, and that stomachache of yours will disappear.

00:05:26.190 --> 00:05:27.130
Put those away.

00:05:27.250 --> 00:05:28.680
What are you thinking?

00:05:30.120 --> 00:05:34.400
I'm a pig! Just fucking fight right now!

00:05:39.420 --> 00:05:44.330
So, Sel, you don't mind if I pick who faces you next, do you?

00:05:44.700 --> 00:05:48.460
Hmm. You actually intend to go through with this?

00:05:48.660 --> 00:05:51.230
How are you doing, Kakarot?

00:05:51.640 --> 00:05:55.140
You must have a plan behind all this... this insanity!

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:59.830
I know it sounds crazy, but you'll understand soon enough.

00:06:00.540 --> 00:06:03.380
The person I have in mind is way stronger than I am.

00:06:03.620 --> 00:06:05.960
So if you enjoyed the challenge of fighting these cells,

00:06:06.220 --> 00:06:08.440
you're going to like this next one that much better.

00:06:08.740 --> 00:06:13.400
I think he said something about butter.

00:06:17.110 --> 00:06:21.680
Of course, you probably won't feel that way about it after he's beaten you.

00:06:22.300 --> 00:06:23.000
What's that?

00:06:23.790 --> 00:06:27.530
I said you probably won't feel that way about it after he beats you.

00:06:27.880 --> 00:06:29.080
A bold statement.

00:06:29.440 --> 00:06:29.960
You should...

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:33.780
I sure do seem to have a lot of confidence in this mystery fighter of yours.

00:06:35.030 --> 00:06:39.420
I just hope for your sake that your confidence has not been misplaced.

00:06:39.780 --> 00:06:43.820
So, where is he? Where is this great invisible champion?

00:06:44.440 --> 00:06:47.600
Oh, he's here. He just doesn't know it yet.

00:06:51.280 --> 00:06:54.400
I'm losing my patience, Goku. Tell me who it is!

00:06:55.270 --> 00:06:56.690
Okay, I will.

00:07:20.890 --> 00:07:22.850
Sal just told him to name the fighter.

00:07:23.770 --> 00:07:27.400
Okay, just let me know who he picks.

00:07:28.310 --> 00:07:29.230
Oh, no.

00:07:29.630 --> 00:07:29.970
He's gonna...

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:31.820
Repent me, I just know it!

00:07:34.640 --> 00:07:35.600
Hey, listen.

00:07:36.300 --> 00:07:38.650
Would you please just tell this guy

00:07:38.650 --> 00:07:41.960
I can't fight right now because I have a stomach ache?

00:07:42.970 --> 00:07:44.200
Uh, okay.

00:07:44.960 --> 00:07:45.700
Okay, guys.

00:07:45.940 --> 00:07:48.160
I'm sorry to say that I can't win this fight.

00:07:48.650 --> 00:07:50.030
I need someone to take over.

00:07:50.150 --> 00:07:56.430
And that someone is you, son.

00:08:00.730 --> 00:08:11.890
what a fool he's gonna destroy his own son he wants me to fight but i can't beat sail i mean

00:08:11.890 --> 00:08:29.910
if my dad can't defeat sail then how can i it's impossible oh my good

00:08:30.280 --> 00:08:34.420
Oh, he's going to make my precious Gohan fight that terrible monster.

00:08:34.820 --> 00:08:36.120
Oh, Gohan!

00:08:36.560 --> 00:08:38.160
Now, Chi-Chi, calm down.

00:08:40.660 --> 00:08:44.600
I think he said he needs someone to take an order.

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:52.320
Maybe they're going to take a break and send for something to eat before he names an ex-fighter.

00:08:52.640 --> 00:08:54.920
You know, I wouldn't mind a little bite myself.

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:03.180
You can do it, son.

00:09:04.620 --> 00:09:07.390
May I fight with... with Cell?

00:09:08.690 --> 00:09:09.250
Disappointing.

00:09:09.900 --> 00:09:13.320
He promises me a challenge and then serves up a sniveling child.

00:09:14.350 --> 00:09:15.870
Goku, stop this.

00:09:16.240 --> 00:09:17.540
Think about what you're doing.

00:09:18.510 --> 00:09:21.750
Think about what's going to happen if you maintain this course of action.

00:09:22.400 --> 00:09:25.020
If Gohan fights Cell, he'll be destroyed.

00:09:26.510 --> 00:09:29.960
Listen, Gohan has a power hidden within him...

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:32.400
that you and I can't even begin to imagine.

00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:34.640
Just think about it.

00:09:35.460 --> 00:09:38.280
Don't you realize that Gohan has been keeping up

00:09:38.360 --> 00:09:40.680
with the rest of us ever since he was just a little boy?

00:09:40.880 --> 00:09:45.500
I can remember back when I was his age,

00:09:45.540 --> 00:09:48.240
and I wasn't even half as strong as he is now.

00:09:49.470 --> 00:09:50.290
Hey, Goku.

00:09:50.650 --> 00:09:53.230
We all know Gohan is strong for his age,

00:09:53.370 --> 00:09:55.540
but taking on Cell.

00:09:57.470 --> 00:09:59.870
You're just going to have to trust me.

00:10:00.350 --> 00:10:02.950
I wouldn't be doing this if I didn't think Gohan could win.

00:10:03.470 --> 00:10:11.700
Look at me, son. Tell me something.

00:10:12.640 --> 00:10:17.140
When Cell and I were fighting earlier, did you have any problems keeping up at all?

00:10:17.580 --> 00:10:20.180
I mean, were we ever moving too fast for you to see?

00:10:20.850 --> 00:10:23.070
No, I could see it all.

00:10:24.020 --> 00:10:27.980
But that's only because you and Cell weren't fighting at your full power.

00:10:28.220 --> 00:10:29.980
I'm sure if you've been moving as fast as you...

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:36.490
you could and I would I don't know about sell son but I was giving it my all you thought I was

00:10:36.490 --> 00:10:46.580
holding back because you were comparing the energy you sensed from me to your own is this

00:10:46.580 --> 00:10:59.280
true he's only a child how could he be more powerful then it's unbelievable

00:11:05.690 --> 00:11:16.100
waiting so what do you say son go out there and win this one for me all right then we can all go home

00:11:16.100 --> 00:11:20.980
all right dad i'll do it

00:11:30.090 --> 00:11:30.550
I'm done.

00:12:08.990 --> 00:12:09.650
How absurd.

00:12:10.700 --> 00:12:13.620
Folks, as you can see, a young boy has just appeared.

00:12:13.940 --> 00:12:17.860
Perhaps this brave lad will be the one to take the monster's order.

00:12:19.100 --> 00:12:20.220
Hey, I'm starving!

00:12:20.910 --> 00:12:22.750
Have him pick up something for me too, will ya?

00:12:30.190 --> 00:12:35.050
What kind of food will satisfy this horrifying creature's dark appetite?

00:12:35.510 --> 00:12:37.120
Will it be Chinese?

00:12:37.620 --> 00:12:39.940
Perhaps submarine sandwiches or pizza?

00:12:40.640 --> 00:12:44.950
Say, dear, doesn't that look like Chi-Chi's son Gohan?

00:12:45.170 --> 00:12:47.450
Seems he's some sort of delivery boy.

00:12:47.670 --> 00:12:50.290
And he used to be such a nice young man, too.

00:12:50.470 --> 00:12:51.690
But just look at him now.

00:12:51.970 --> 00:12:53.050
Oh, my!

00:12:53.390 --> 00:12:56.510
He's gone and dyed his hair like some sort of little horn-lum.

00:12:57.020 --> 00:12:59.100
Chi-Chi must be at her wit's end.

00:12:59.100 --> 00:12:59.720
well

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:03.880
At least he's got a job, unlike that karate, my father of his.

00:13:07.450 --> 00:13:09.170
Gohan, what in the world?

00:13:10.770 --> 00:13:14.490
I'm not sure about you, Bulma, but I got a bad feeling about this.

00:13:17.500 --> 00:13:19.860
Grilling, still have some of those senzu beans?

00:13:20.200 --> 00:13:21.360
Let me have one, all right?

00:13:21.770 --> 00:13:22.010
Huh?

00:13:23.210 --> 00:13:25.440
Oh, sure.

00:13:25.860 --> 00:13:26.820
Great, thanks.

00:13:29.080 --> 00:13:29.760
Hey, Cell!

00:13:30.350 --> 00:13:30.970
Catch!

00:13:32.560 --> 00:13:33.120
Hey!

00:13:33.750 --> 00:13:35.710
You're gonna need all the help you can get!

00:13:39.490 --> 00:13:41.050
That's a senzu bean!

00:13:42.060 --> 00:13:42.560
Enjoy!

00:13:42.920 --> 00:13:44.060
Oh, alright!

00:13:44.060 --> 00:13:44.920
It's official!

00:13:45.240 --> 00:13:46.780
You've lost your marbles!

00:13:47.120 --> 00:13:49.160
Look, Cell's pretty trained right now.

00:13:49.620 --> 00:13:53.180
It just wouldn't be fair if Gohan defeats him when he isn't at his best, you know?

00:13:55.160 --> 00:13:55.720
That's...

00:13:55.810 --> 00:13:57.150
That's Cell up there!

00:13:57.460 --> 00:13:59.680
Who really cares about being fair?

00:14:01.580 --> 00:14:09.920
What a fool. Doesn't he realize the only thing he's managed to do here is ensure his son's demise?

00:14:11.030 --> 00:14:16.500
Thank you, Goku. I'll take this without a second thought.

00:14:18.200 --> 00:14:22.880
Your overconfidence has betrayed you. You will regret this. I promise you.

00:14:47.400 --> 00:14:48.900
Let's get started!

00:14:50.060 --> 00:14:53.120
Hey! We can't let Gohan go through with this!

00:14:54.440 --> 00:14:58.650
No, I'm afraid it's too late to turn back now, Krillin.

00:14:59.270 --> 00:14:59.970
Well ch-

00:15:00.380 --> 00:15:01.620
Are you ready?

00:15:31.600 --> 00:15:51.990
If I'm mistaken, he may be more powerful than Goku.

00:15:56.930 --> 00:15:57.710
That's incredible.

00:16:12.760 --> 00:16:14.960
There is more to this boy than I first thought.

00:16:15.370 --> 00:16:19.390
Oh, this is amazing.

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:26.960
Gohan, he's, he's, he is far more powerful than I had ever thought possible.

00:16:39.610 --> 00:16:41.970
Gohan, I hope you are ready.

00:16:42.440 --> 00:16:44.340
You're not going to get a second chance.

00:16:45.190 --> 00:16:47.240
He's going to do this.

00:16:48.420 --> 00:16:51.820
How can he expect to be any kind of a match against Cell?

00:16:53.340 --> 00:16:57.500
Well, maybe Goku wasn't entirely bluffing about his son's strength.

00:16:58.940 --> 00:16:59.980
Of course, it was a bit...

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:19.340
of an exaggeration to say that he was stronger than me but no bother i'll give you one thing

00:17:19.340 --> 00:17:26.000
you definitely are brave and loyal too not many sons would be willing to fight their

00:17:26.000 --> 00:17:29.840
father's battles for them you know your devotion really is quite

00:17:30.440 --> 00:17:30.880
Remarkable.

00:17:58.450 --> 00:17:59.210
That's the way!

00:18:02.360 --> 00:18:04.220
This is too much.

00:18:05.340 --> 00:18:06.000
Go on.

00:18:07.170 --> 00:18:09.040
Unbelievable, young lad.

00:18:09.120 --> 00:18:10.180
We thought it was a delivery boy

00:18:10.180 --> 00:18:11.560
has actually begun to fight.

00:18:12.120 --> 00:18:14.580
And incredibly enough, he's holding his own.

00:18:14.820 --> 00:18:16.580
But against a monster such as Cell,

00:18:16.950 --> 00:18:19.130
how long can a child last, really?

00:18:38.510 --> 00:18:39.950
You're pretty fast, aren't you?

00:18:41.240 --> 00:18:44.000
What do you say we try shifting things into high gear?

00:18:44.710 --> 00:18:52.200
Wait, this was a mistake.

00:18:55.020 --> 00:18:58.810
Koo, you've got to help him before it's too late!

00:19:06.620 --> 00:19:09.740
Oh, no! My baby! Please, stop!

00:19:11.490 --> 00:19:22.390
Don't you even care? Huh?

00:19:23.660 --> 00:19:27.260
Oku, if you don't step in there, this is gonna be Gohan's last fight ever!

00:19:41.580 --> 00:19:59.980
He used to have an unwavering belief in his son's abilities, but the rest of the Z-Files...

00:20:00.840 --> 00:20:09.180
And for good reason, Gohan's heading into round two of a momentous battle against probably the most feared villain ever to terrorize the Earth.

00:20:09.500 --> 00:20:16.040
And one thing's for sure, the brave young Super Saiyan is going to need a whole lot more than just his father's confidence to win this one.

00:20:16.370 --> 00:20:19.930
The fate of an entire planet rests on the tender shoulders of a child.

00:20:20.330 --> 00:20:24.170
Can Gohan muster the needed strength and courage to defeat this depraved predator?

00:20:24.550 --> 00:20:29.510
Stay tuned for scenes from the next exciting episode of Dragon Ball Z.

00:20:34.670 --> 00:20:39.450
In the next episode of Dragon Ball Z, the ultimate matchup is here at last.

00:20:39.710 --> 00:20:43.050
The Earth's most powerful fighters have gathered together to decide the fate of the world,

00:20:43.190 --> 00:20:46.670
but it just might be the smallest among them who proves to be the hero.

00:20:46.950 --> 00:20:51.270
It's Gohan versus Cell, next time on Dragon Ball Z.
